{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本著名漫畫家千葉徹彌，今日(27日)證實於本月22日逝世，享年87歲。</p><p>千葉徹彌以經典拳擊漫畫《鐵拳浪子》聞名，創作生涯推出多部暢銷作品，並曾擔任日本漫畫家協會會長，對日本戰後漫畫文化發展貢獻深遠。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:42:23.561875+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:38:18.901273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:38:18.901273+00:00","content_hash":"7505375ed0b023c5d15fc50dcc6dbca488926b17bfa815824bfce8ddfa0da2ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}